  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 45 01}说好了，好还是可以？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e400_190.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
